fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth264parser.html#gst_h264_parser_parse_sps","fragment":"\n\tgst_h264_parser_parse_sps\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.prototype.h264_parser_parse_sps\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.h264_parser_parse_sps\n\nParses nalu containing a Sequence Parameter Set, and fills sps.\nParameters:\na GstH264NalParser\nThe GST_H264_NAL_SPS GstH264NalUnit to parse\nThe GstH264SPS to fill.\na GstH264ParserResult\nParses nalu containing a Sequence Parameter Set, and fills sps.\nParameters:\na GstCodecParsers.H264NalParser\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnitType.SPS GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnit to parse\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264SPS to fill.\na GstCodecParsers.H264ParserResult\nParses nalu containing a Sequence Parameter Set, and fills sps.\nParameters:\na GstCodecParsers.H264NalParser\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnitType.SPS GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnit to parse\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264SPS to fill.\na GstCodecParsers.H264ParserResult\n"});